HED version="1.0.0" library="testaux" withStandard="8.5.0" unmerged="True"

'''Prologue'''
testaux 1.0.0 is the auxiliary-items library of the hed-tests test schema set, partnered with standard schema 8.5.0. It declares one auxiliary element of each type - unit class auxUnits with units auxunit and bigauxunit, unit modifier auxMod, value class auxClass, and schema attribute auxAttribute - plus the tags Aux-measure and Aux-value that use them, so the auxiliary-section merge rules have fully controlled probes. testclash 13.0.0 and later carry probe copies of these elements, identical except for at most one controlled difference. It has no predecessor.

!# start schema

'''Aux-measure''' <nowiki>[A tag that takes a value with units of the auxUnits unit class.]</nowiki>
* <nowiki># {takesValue, unitClass=auxUnits}[Value of Aux-measure.]</nowiki>

'''Aux-value''' <nowiki>[A tag that takes a value of the auxClass value class.]</nowiki>
* <nowiki># {takesValue, valueClass=auxClass}[Value of Aux-value.]</nowiki>

!# end schema

'''Unit classes'''
* auxUnits <nowiki>{defaultUnits=auxunit}[The auxiliary unit class shared across libraries in the aux merge cases.]</nowiki>
** auxunit <nowiki>{conversionFactor=1.0}[The base unit of the auxUnits unit class.]</nowiki>
** bigauxunit <nowiki>{conversionFactor=1000.0}[A larger unit of the auxUnits unit class.]</nowiki>

'''Unit modifiers'''
* auxMod <nowiki>{SIUnitModifier, conversionFactor=100.0}[The auxiliary unit modifier shared across libraries in the aux merge cases.]</nowiki>

'''Value classes'''
* auxClass <nowiki>{allowedCharacter=letters}[The auxiliary value class shared across libraries in the aux merge cases.]</nowiki>

'''Schema attributes'''
* auxAttribute <nowiki>{boolRange}[The auxiliary schema attribute shared across libraries in the aux merge cases.]</nowiki>

'''Properties'''

'''Epilogue'''
